(1,1,'My Farmhouse Hotel','A peaceful farmhouse stay surrounded by nature, gardens and open skies.','<div>\n    <h4><strong>Welcome to My Farmhouse Hotel!</strong></h4>\n    <br />\n    <div>Nestled amid green fields and quiet country lanes, My Farmhouse Hotel is where nature meets comfort. Wake up to birdsong, breathe fresh air, and slow down in a warm, homely setting.</div>\n    <br />\n    <div><strong>Rooms &amp; Cottages:</strong></div>\n    <div>Our cozy rooms and cottages blend rustic charm with modern comfort. Each one features a plush bed, hot shower, free Wi-Fi, and windows that open onto gardens or farmland views.</div>\n    <br />\n    <div><strong>Farm-Fresh Dining:</strong></div>\n    <div>Our kitchen serves home-style meals prepared with vegetables and herbs grown on the farm. Enjoy hearty breakfasts, fresh juices, and seasonal specialties in our garden-side dining area.</div>\n    <br />\n    <div><strong>Around the Farm:</strong></div>\n    <div>Spend your days walking through orchards, relaxing by the lawns, or gathering around the bonfire in the evening. Families love our open spaces and friendly farm animals.</div>\n    <br />\n    <div><strong>Location:</strong></div>\n    <div>Tucked away from the city noise yet easy to reach, the farmhouse is the perfect escape for weekends and holidays. Whether you come to unwind or to explore the countryside, you will always find a warm welcome.</div>\n    <br />\n    <div><strong>Book Your Stay:</strong></div>\n    <div>Ready to trade city hustle for fresh air and open skies? Book your stay at My Farmhouse Hotel today and let nature take care of the rest.</div>\n</div>\n','<div>\n                <div>- Accommodation will only be provided to guests whose details are registered with the hotel front desk.</div>\n                <div>- Guests are required to show a valid photo identification during check-in.</div>\n                <div>- GST / Taxes are charged extra and applicable as per government directives.</div>\n                <div>- 100 % advance Payment deposit at the time of Check-in.</div>\n                <div>- The check-in time is 12:00 PM &amp; check-out time is 11:00 AM. (Subject to availability, early check-in, and late check-out will be considered)</div>\n                <div>- The hotel may deny further accommodation to a guest who does not prove to be decent and comply with the hotel policy and rules.</div>\n                <div>- The guest has to bear any loss caused by them to the hotel property.</div></div>'),
(2,1,'Gomti Mango House','A demonstration farmhouse outside Lucknow, imagined for long mango-season lunches and quiet Gomti evenings. Demo stay with representative imagery.','<p>A demonstration farmhouse outside Lucknow, imagined for long mango-season lunches and quiet Gomti evenings. This client-demo listing uses representative imagery and is ready for real content replacement.</p>','<p>Demo property. Booking controls use the standard QloApps flow.</p>'),
(3,1,'Orchard Ridge Farmstay','A demonstration countryside stay framed by orchards, open rock country and slow sunsets in Bundelkhand. Demo stay with representative imagery.','<p>A demonstration countryside stay framed by orchards, open rock country and slow sunsets in Bundelkhand. This client-demo listing uses representative imagery and is ready for real content replacement.</p>','<p>Demo property. Booking controls use the standard QloApps flow.</p>'),
(4,1,'Yamuna Courtyard Farmstay','A demonstration farmstay near the Yamuna, imagined around shaded courtyards, village walks and Braj mornings. Demo stay with representative imagery.','<p>A demonstration farmstay near the Yamuna, imagined around shaded courtyards, village walks and Braj mornings. This client-demo listing uses representative imagery and is ready for real content replacement.</p>','<p>Demo property. Booking controls use the standard QloApps flow.</p>'),
(5,1,'Sarayu Fields Retreat','A demonstration retreat for river plains, rice fields and unhurried days close to the Sarayu. Demo stay with representative imagery.','<p>A demonstration retreat for river plains, rice fields and unhurried days close to the Sarayu. This client-demo listing uses representative imagery and is ready for real content replacement.</p>','<p>Demo property. Booking controls use the standard QloApps flow.</p>'),
(6,1,'Terai Wetlands Farmstay','A demonstration farmstay for bird-rich wetlands, cane fields and the softer edge of the Terai. Demo stay with representative imagery.','<p>A demonstration farmstay for bird-rich wetlands, cane fields and the softer edge of the Terai. This client-demo listing uses representative imagery and is ready for real content replacement.</p>','<p>Demo property. Booking controls use the standard QloApps flow.</p>'),
(7,1,'Ganga Looms Country House','A demonstration country house beyond Varanasi, imagined around handlooms, fields and the Ganga plain. Demo stay with representative imagery.','<p>A demonstration country house beyond Varanasi, imagined around handlooms, fields and the Ganga plain. This client-demo listing uses representative imagery and is ready for real content replacement.</p>','<p>Demo property. Booking controls use the standard QloApps flow.</p>');
